MFLOW 2
NAME Silo storage
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 A blower lifts sand and fluff up the riser and\ndrops it through the roof of silo 1. Its gate\n(30%) lets the store out slowly.\nSilo 2 is filled through a pipe in its side;\nits gate is shut, so it only stores.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Open the gate of silo 2 to empty it.\nShut the gate of silo 1 and watch it fill.\nLock the Process layer (F6): the parts cannot\nbe changed, but they still work.

